        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Endapo nywele za mnadhiri zitatiwa unajisi mtu afapo ghafla karibu naye, atakinyoa kichwa chake wakati wa siku ya kutakaswa kwake; atakinyoa katika siku ya saba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika siku ya nane atapeleka hua wawili au makinda mawili ya njiwa kwa kuhani penye lango la hema la mkutano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhani atamtoa mmoja kuwa sadaka ya kuondoa dhambi na mwingine kuwa sadaka ya kuteketezwa, naye atamfanyia upatanisho, kwa sababu alitenda dhambi kwa ajili ya maiti. Siku hiyohiyo, atakiweka wakfu kichwa chake ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kujiweka wakfu kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa siku zake za kujitenga. Hizo siku za kwanza hazitahesabiwa kwa sababu nywele zake zilizokuwa zimewekwa wakfu zimetiwa unajisi. Atatoa mwanakondoo dume wa mwaka mmoja kuwa sadaka ya hatia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
